<title>USA: Vanguard Air extends low fare sale.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Air extends low fare sale.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanguard Airlines Inc said Monday it is extending through January 6 a low fare sales program.</p>
<p>It said travel under the Incredibly-Low-Everywhere-We-Go program must be completed by June 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Vanguard also extended its Kids Fly Free program through January 6. A child who flies with a fare-paying adult can fly free under the program.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
